# Large captured model data — released separately (e.g. Zenodo); SHA-256 hashes are
# recorded in DATA_MANIFEST.md and the per-file receipts under data/frozen/.
data/raw/*.csv

# Fetched context / ground truth (regenerable from public sources; large)
inputs/*.json
docs/*.json
data/outcomes/*.json

# Transient, regenerated by `make analyze/render/paper`
claims.json
PILOT_RESULTS.md
paper/manuscript_filled.md

# Environment / OS / build cruft
logs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.aux
*.log
*.out

# NOTE: intentionally COMMITTED (provenance + reproducibility):
#   data/frozen/*.freeze.json  (hash receipts)
#   figures/*.png              (so the paper compiles from a clone)
#   claims_<pair>.json, results_<pair>.md, tempsweep_<pair>.json  (released results)
